    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/c4994cd68a33f14df4f023d7dfc5ab36.avif?t=1754341604\" data-has-big width=800 height=111 /></span>Experience one of fiction's most notorious boss battles! Scour the wreckage of your ship for weapons and supplies. Fend off waves of ferocious sharks,   deadly jellyfish and changing weather as you attempt to take down the leviathan Moby Dick.\u00a0It's a chance to rewrite history in this fight to the death!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/cfc3c001eba8cf8cc6776a0e0e25f6e5.webp?t=1754341604\" data-has-big width=800 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/8ed3e4229243ff791b7dc28e26bc2884.poster.avif?t=1754341604\" width=702 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/8ed3e4229243ff791b7dc28e26bc2884.webm?t=1754341604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/8ed3e4229243ff791b7dc28e26bc2884.mp4?t=1754341604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/34beb763835aea9a1115841b8fb8a266.poster.avif?t=1754341604\" width=702 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439980/extras/34beb763835aea9a1115841b8fb8a266.webm?t=1754341604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/34